        <mxCell id="tech_notes_content" value="&lt;b&gt;Frontend:&lt;/b&gt; React.js/Vue.js, Material-UI, Google Maps JavaScript API, Redux/Vuex&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backend:&lt;/b&gt; Python 3.8+, Flask/FastAPI, JWT Auth, Celery, Redis&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Algorithms:&lt;/b&gt; scikit-learn (K-means), DEAP (Genetic Algorithm), pandas, numpy, geopy&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Database:&lt;/b&gt; MySQL 8.0+, Redis Cache, S3/GCS File Storage&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;APIs:&lt;/b&gt; Google Places, Google Reviews, Distance Matrix, Google Maps&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Infrastructure:&lt;/b&gt; Nginx, Gunicorn, Docker, Monitoring (Prometheus/Sentry)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Deployment:&lt;/b&gt; VPS, PaaS (Heroku), Docker+K8s, or Serverless (AWS Lambda)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Cost Estimate:&lt;/b&gt; $20-500/month depending on traffic&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Development Time:&lt;/b&gt; 12-14 weeks for full implementation" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;" parent="KdVMDUrWjtmgpNoFBbIr-1" vertex="1">
